<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Privacy Policy | The Cross-Border Risk Review</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Privacy Policy for The Cross-Border Risk Review" />
</head>
<body>
  <main style="max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 60px 24px; line-height: 1.8; color: #e5e7eb; background: #0B1322; min-height: 100vh;">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p>Effective Date: May 2026</p>

    <p>This website, https://www.manojteja.com, is operated as an editorial and professional knowledge platform edited by Manoj Teja Yadlapati.</p>

    <h2>Information Collection</h2>
    <p>This website may collect limited personal information voluntarily submitted through contact forms, including name, email address, and message content.</p>

    <h2>Use of Information</h2>
    <p>Information submitted through this website is used solely for professional communication, responding to enquiries, and improving website experience.</p>

    <h2>Analytics</h2>
    <p>This website uses Google Analytics to understand website traffic and visitor interactions. Google may collect anonymized usage information in accordance with its own privacy policies.</p>

    <h2>Cookies</h2>
    <p>This website may use cookies and similar technologies to improve user experience and analytics performance.</p>

    <h2>Third-Party Links</h2>
    <p>This website may contain links to external websites including LinkedIn and other professional resources. External websites operate under their own privacy practices.</p>

    <h2>Data Protection</h2>
    <p>Reasonable efforts are taken to protect submitted information; however, no internet transmission method is completely secure.</p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>For privacy-related enquiries, please use the contact section available on the website.</p>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
